Compare a fresh checkout of the upstream commit with `code-oss/`, ignoring the
vendor-time exclusions above. Every remaining difference must be covered by
one of these entries:

- `README.md`: fork orientation and npm-only build rule.
- `package.json` and `package-lock.json`: omit tasks and runtime dependencies
  for the excluded Copilot extension. Also removes dependencies whose features Review never
